  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The single most important step is to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "squeeze dry",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "squeeze-dry"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the grated potato thoroughly. Excess moisture means the pancakes will steam rather than fry and will never crisp up. Makes about 12, serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Serve straight from the pan. They lose their crispness very quickly and are best eaten immediately."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "potato",
              "amount": 800,
              "unit": "g",
